# Needs the layout build: flutter build apk --debug --dart-define=PROBE_AGENT=true --dart-define=PROBE_FIXTURE_WIDGETS=layout (see the README).
# What each test shows is also in docs/compat/MATRIX.md: a matrix cell is set only from a test that ran.
# Widgets a person cannot see or cannot tap. Each button counts its taps in the state line, so a test shows whether a tap arrived. Some
# tests pin what the agent does today where it differs from what a person sees: those are findings, marked FINDING.

before each test
  restart the app
  # the last element of the screen with an id: right after a restart the screen can still be being built (issue #793)
  wait until #wf_layout_state appears

# FINDING: an Opacity(0) button is invisible to a person, but `see` finds it and `tap` presses it (Flutter hit-tests a transparent
# widget, so a person's tap on that spot would press it too).
test "an Opacity(0) button is seen and tapped"
  see "Faded button"
  tap "Faded button"
  see "Faded: 1"

test "a Visibility(visible: false) widget is not seen, kept in the tree or not, and neither is an Offstage one"
  see "Faded: 0"
  don't see "Kept hidden"
  don't see "Gone text"
  don't see "Offstage text"

# FINDING: an IgnorePointer button is seen, and `tap` passes while the tap does nothing. Before the fix for issue #842 there was no
# warning at all; with it the step prints `is inside an IgnorePointer, so it receives no taps` (and fails under --fail-on-warning).
test "a tap on an IgnorePointer button passes and does nothing"
  see "Ignored button"
  tap "Ignored button"
  see "Ignored: 0"

# An AbsorbPointer button: the tap does nothing; the agent prints a warning that the target is covered.
test "a tap on an AbsorbPointer button does nothing"
  see "Absorbed button"
  tap "Absorbed button"
  see "Absorbed: 0"

# FINDING: a button fully covered in a Stack is seen; `tap` lands on what is on top, as a person's tap would. The cover counts it, so
# the screen changes and the agent gives no warning.
test "a tap on a covered button lands on the cover"
  see "Covered button"
  tap "Covered button"
  see "Covered: 0"
  see "Cover: 1"

test "every reachable element is found by its id"
  see #wf_faded
  see #wf_ignored
  see #wf_absorbed
  see #wf_covered
  see #wf_cover
